Package: labFlow
Title: Ingest and Reconcile Environmental Monitoring Laboratory Data
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R:
    person("R. Shannon", role = c("aut", "cre"),
           email = "burrows_51mustard@icloud.com")
Description: An email-triggered pipeline that ingests environmental
    monitoring results from heterogeneous laboratory and field sources
    (CSV, XLS/XLSX, PDF), reconciles them against a canonical analyte,
    feature and method registry, and stores them in a DuckDB-backed
    monitoring database with links to the archived original files.
    Lab- and format-specific parsers ("adapters") emit a common
    intermediate representation, so new laboratories, samplers or file
    formats can be added without touching the shared ingestion,
    reconciliation and storage machinery. Part of the 'tidyWaste' family
    of packages.
URL: https://github.com/vorpalvorpal/labFlow
BugReports: https://github.com/vorpalvorpal/labFlow/issues
